OL,3,GNEWSADisgraced ex-Reform Wales leader
OL,4,Awho took pro-Russian bribes must pay
OL,5,A#22k
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former leader of Reform UK in Wales
OL,8,Fhas been ordered to pay more than
OL,9,F#22,500 after accepting bribes to make
OL,10,Fpro-Russian speeches in the European
OL,11,FParliament.
OL,13,FGill, 53, of Llangefni on Anglesey, was
OL,14,Fsentenced to ten-and-a-half years in
OL,15,Fprison in November 2025 after pleading
OL,16,Fguilty to eight counts of bribery under
OL,17,Fthe Bribery Act 2010.
OL,19,FHe is thought to have received up to
OL,20,F#40,000 to help pro-Russian politicians
OL,21,Fin Ukraine, while he was a Member of
OL,22,Fthe European Parliament (MEP).
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
