OL,3,GNEWSADisgraced ex-Reform Wales leader
OL,4,Awho took pro-Russian bribes must pay
OL,5,A#22k
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt the Old Bailey on Thursday he was
OL,8,Fgiven six months to sell a rental
OL,9,Fproperty to pay the money to the UK
OL,10,Fgovernment, or face a further nine
OL,11,Fmonths in prison.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
